{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1126.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"9970e9b03b91538dedcb61d93d5d3533d6a78d7fe118d29a63b79a0bb195f690","ja":"ショッピングバトルが始まってから、数十分後……","zh":"购物对决开始几十分钟后……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1126.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"b2bf9db0dc1a92fe58999c201c3247cf53a5ad36e569ef256a7555b34aa49842","ja":"あっ、リツコ～♪\nもう買うものは決まった？","zh":"啊，律子～♪\n已经决定好要买什么了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1126.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"cfded38b5ef123503c582b87971799b391c988d18c672b7d6eeafb31a18bd76e","ja":"ええ、まぁ大体はね。\nエレナはまだ悩んでるってところかしら？","zh":"嗯，大致算是吧。\n艾莲娜应该还在纠结吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1126.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"23ebd687448181f92479a819154c5311c6fbdeb49f623cd8da653f7bd088141a","ja":"そうなノ。カワイイ服は見つけたんだけど、\nまだ3000円には足りないかなって。","zh":"是这样呀。虽然找到了可爱的衣服，\n但感觉还差3000日元不够呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1126.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"3b6f0cd8ffa31ddf5387f5af2b9576a7b6ad8413d607af6bd4fe9dad42c5ee9e","ja":"（エレナもいい感じに予算内に収まりそうね……\nうん！　私ももっとギリギリを攻めないと……！）","zh":"（艾莲娜那边看来也能刚好控制在预算内呢……\n嗯！我也得更加卡着极限去挑战才行……！）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1126.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"dd3b7dc0296afb14e76436efb37ee6c109692da5d3453b8d1016b16ba15daf30","ja":"「タイムアウト～！　それでは選んだ商品を\n紹介してください！　まずは律子ちゃんから！」","zh":"“时间到～！那么请介绍一下\n选好的商品吧！首先从小律子开始！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1126.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"b04a63ce0430ec192ec7a013ee97ae25725ab4b2f7fa2cf166dad56b1a00ecd0","ja":"私は大人デートをテーマに、ワンピースと\nネックレス、それにサンダルをチョイスしました！","zh":"我以成熟约会为主题，挑选了连衣裙、\n项链，还有凉鞋！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1126.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"345f2de770ec0ba80812b6a392b2dd64f02ded5b174dd912aa44f53a81c928d7","ja":"「上品な中にかわいらしさのある、素敵な\nコーデですね！　総額はなんと～……2950円です！」","zh":"「高雅之中又带着可爱，真是一套很棒的\n穿搭呢！总价竟然有～……2950日元！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1126.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"165ae044747648722cef1d5a25122386dad76e50f60ba31808f3f65ce2707af9","ja":"わぁっ、すごいよリツコ～！","zh":"哇，太厉害了律子～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1126.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"4f57538db6ee93104c459032f58d26164c00ff1cffb979f2a716bb0d6794d15b","ja":"律子さんは、お買い物マエストロだったんですね♪","zh":"律子小姐原来是购物大师呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1126.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"5b1f1e0f533e556080b09aa4b78269cbd97fcb95d51809e22e5c377b8f520361","ja":"ふふっ！\nほぼ見立て通りの値段で私も満足しています♪","zh":"呵呵！\n价格和我预估的基本一致，我也很满意♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1126.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"e6c76f0aebb0ecfe7f9eb9f69d658f02c2a10dc316f3a62f95b75c64f5667a69","ja":"「超ニアピンの律子ちゃんに勝てるのか！　では続いて\n麗花ちゃんの選んだ商品を……えっ、これは！？」","zh":"“能赢过成绩极其接近的律子吗！那么接下来就看\n丽花选的商品……咦，这是！？”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1126.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"d617b516b3cda0fbf66d4d64ab35a115f362fc66e99fdb014153ecebeb6e9ec8","ja":"えっ！？　な、何、これ……！？","zh":"诶！？这、这是什么……！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
